UID:national-gallery-x-connected-canvas-2027@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261104T162448Z
DTSTART:20261117T232900Z
DTEND:20261117T235900Z
SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 GMT: Connected Canvas: The National Gallery Digital 
 Commission 2027 (emerging UK creatives)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 17 Nov 2026 at 23:59 GMT.\n\nNational Gallery X commissi
 ons a new digital\, generative\, screen-based or sound work for its three-
 screen LED canvas in the gallery. Open to UK-based emerging creatives in t
 heir first five years of practice who are not in full-time education. TO A
 PPLY: an expression of interest by 17 November 2026\, 23:59 UK time\; shor
 tlisted applicants join an IdeasLab and pitch in February 2027.\n\nOrganis
 ation: National Gallery (National Gallery X)\, London\nLocation: National 
 Gallery\, London\, UK. Open to UK-based emerging creatives.\nAward: GBP 15
 \,000 commission. Up to 10 shortlisted applicants receive GBP 500 each to 
 develop proposals.\nDuration: IdeasLab 13 January 2027\; pitches 1-2 Febru
 ary 2027\; work shown on a three-screen LED canvas 30 April to 4 June 2027
 .\n\nMore: https://www.nationalgallery.org.uk/national-gallery-x/connected
 -canvas?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.nationalgallery.org.uk/national-gallery-x/connected-canvas?
 utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:National Gallery\, London\, UK. Open to UK-based emerging creative
 s.
END:VEVENT
